{"discussions":[{"id":"dd2adc70-a526-11f1-8080-80017373e029","post":{"id":"dd2adc70-a526-11f1-8080-80017373e029","owner":{"id":"5854167","username":"BigTech","firstName":"Large Tech","lastName":"Market Cap","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/5572968/5.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/5572968/5.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/5572968/5.jpg"},"roles":["eTorian","CopyPortfolio","Verified","Regular","Depositor"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":218,"piLevel":0},"obsoleteId":"7d14a9cf-a779-4c63-9a44-34cbb9eb9fab","created":"2026-08-31T10:29:36.311Z","message":{"text":"🍎 Apple Enters a New Era — With AI at the Center\n\n👉 $AAPL is beginning a major leadership transition, with John Ternus set to take over as CEO after Tim Cook’s 15-year tenure.\n\n👉 The change comes at a pivotal moment for Apple. The company remains one of the world’s most powerful consumer technology businesses, but investors are increasingly focused on how quickly it can strengthen its position in artificial intelligence.\n\n👉 Ternus brings a distinctly hardware-focused background, having led engineering across Apple’s product lineup. That could prove especially relevant as AI becomes more deeply integrated into devices rather than existing only in the cloud.\n\n👉 Apple’s next chapter may therefore be defined by how effectively it combines AI with the products people already use every day — from the iPhone and Mac to wearables and future device categories.\n\n👉 The timing is also significant. Apple’s next iPhone event is just days away, with expectations building around new hardware and a potentially important redesign cycle.\n\n👉 Tim Cook will remain involved as executive chairman, giving Ternus room to focus on product and technology strategy while Apple continues navigating a complex global supply chain and geopolitical environment.\n\n💡 One interesting takeaway:\n\nApple may not need to “win” AI by building the biggest model.\n\nIts advantage could come from distribution.\n\nFew companies have such a large installed base of premium devices, operating systems and services. If Apple can make AI genuinely useful at the device level, it could turn hardware into one of the most powerful channels for mainstream AI adoption.\n\n❓ POLL: What should be John Ternus’ top priority as Apple enters the AI era?\n\n✨ The @BigTech Smart Portfolio provides exposure to the world’s largest technology companies driving innovation across AI, cloud computing, semiconductors, digital platforms and next-generation consumer technology.\n\n🔗 Read more: https://www.dawn.com/news/2026362\n\nPast performance is not an indication of future results.","languageCode":"en-gb"},"updated":"2026-08-31T10:29:36.311Z","isDeleted":false,"type":"Poll","metadata":{"poll":{"id":235094,"title":"🍎 Apple Enters a New Era — With AI at the Center\n\n👉 $AAPL is beginning a major leadership transition, with John Ternus set to take over as CEO after Tim Cook’s 15-year tenure.\n\n👉 The change comes at a pivotal moment for Apple. The company remains one of the world’s most powerful consumer technology businesses, but investors are increasingly focused on how quickly it can strengthen its position in artificial intelligence.\n\n👉 Ternus brings a distinctly hardware-focused background, having led engineering across Apple’s product lineup. That could prove especially relevant as AI becomes more deeply integrated into devices rather than existing only in the cloud.\n\n👉 Apple’s next chapter may therefore be defined by how effectively it combines AI with the products people already use every day — from the iPhone and Mac to wearables and future device categories.\n\n👉 The timing is also significant. Apple’s next iPhone event is just days away, with expectations building around new hardware and a potentially important redesign cycle.\n\n👉 Tim Cook will remain involved as executive chairman, giving Ternus room to focus on product and technology strategy while Apple continues navigating a complex global supply chain and geopolitical environment.\n\n💡 One interesting takeaway:\n\nApple may not need to “win” AI by building the biggest model.\n\nIts advantage could come from distribution.\n\nFew companies have such a large installed base of premium devices, operating systems and services. If Apple can make AI genuinely useful at the device level, it could turn hardware into one of the most powerful channels for mainstream AI adoption.\n\n❓ POLL: What should be John Ternus’ top priority as Apple enters the AI era?\n\n✨ The @BigTech Smart Portfolio provides exposure to the world’s largest technology companies driving innovation across AI, cloud computing, semiconductors, digital platforms and next-generation consumer technology.\n\n🔗 Read more: https://www.dawn.com/news/2026362\n\nPast performance is not an indication of future results.","gcid":5854167,"options":[{"id":747729,"index":1,"text":"Catch up in AI","isUserVoted":false,"votesCount":59},{"id":747730,"index":2,"text":"Lead in on-device AI","isUserVoted":false,"votesCount":34},{"id":747731,"index":3,"text":"Reinvent hardware","isUserVoted":false,"votesCount":22},{"id":747732,"index":4,"text":"Expand into new categories","isUserVoted":false,"votesCount":15}],"totalVotes":130}},"attachments":[],"tags":[{"market":{"id":"1001","symbolName":"AAPL","displayName":"Apple","updated":"2026-09-01T08:15:55.386Z","assetType":"Stocks","internalId":1001,"avatar":{"small":"/medium/Apple.png","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/aapl/90x90.png","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/aapl/150x150.png","svg":{"url":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/market-avatars/1001/1001_494D5A_F7F7F7.svg","backgroundColor":"#494D5A","textColor":"#F7F7F7"}},"application":"eToro","metadata":"","assetTypeId":5,"assetTypeSubCategoryId":0}}],"mentions":[{"user":{"id":"5854167","username":"BigTech","firstName":"Large Tech","lastName":"Market Cap","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/5572968/5.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/5572968/5.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/5572968/5.jpg"},"roles":["eTorian","CopyPortfolio","Verified","Regular","Depositor"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":218,"piLevel":0},"isDirect":false}],"isSpam":false,"editStatus":"None"},"commentsData":{"reactionPaging":{"totalCount":5},"comments":[{"entity":{"message":{"text":"I'm looking forward to the next hardware. It looks like it's going to be pretty much the same as last year, but at a higher price","languageCode":"en-gb"},"updated":"2026-09-02T17:03:26.507Z","isSpam":false,"editStatus":"Edited","id":"5933dde3-e2f6-480b-b54f-c944f99be62e","owner":{"id":"3112137","username":"CCalle","firstName":"Cristia","lastName":"Calle Mercado","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/2854589/7.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/2854589/7.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/2854589/7.jpg"},"roles":["PI","Verified","Regular","Depositor"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":191,"piLevel":5},"obsoleteId":"5933dde3-e2f6-480b-b54f-c944f99be62e","parent":{"id":"dd2adc70-a526-11f1-8080-80017373e029","obsoleteId":"dd2adc70-a526-11f1-8080-80017373e029","type":"Post"},"created":"2026-09-02T12:23:06.831Z"},"repliesCount":0,"emotionsData":{"like":{"paging":{"totalCount":1},"emotions":[{"type":"Like","id":"like_5933dde3-e2f6-480b-b54f-c944f99be62e_6373077","owner":{"id":"6373077","username":"jmartinm015","firstName":"Juan Jose","lastName":"Martin Mendez","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/6088065/19.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/6088065/19.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/6088065/19.jpg"},"roles":["PI","Verified","Regular","Depositor"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":191,"piLevel":4},"parent":{"parent":{"id":"dd2adc70-a526-11f1-8080-80017373e029","obsoleteId":"dd2adc70-a526-11f1-8080-80017373e029","type":"Post"},"id":"5933dde3-e2f6-480b-b54f-c944f99be62e","obsoleteId":"5933dde3-e2f6-480b-b54f-c944f99be62e","type":"Comment"},"created":"2026-09-02T13:35:07.722Z"}]}},"requesterContext":{"isFlaggingAsSpam":false,"isSubscribed":false,"isLiking":false,"isSaved":false,"isPinned":false,"isRequesterBlocking":false,"isInteractionRestricted":false,"isFollowing":false,"isOwner":false},"replies":[]},{"entity":{"message":{"text":"thoughtful post. I agree that Apple’s greatest AI advantage may be its enormous distribution network rather than having the largest model. The leadership transition makes this a particularly interesting period for the company","languageCode":"en-gb"},"updated":"2026-09-02T17:03:18.564Z","isSpam":false,"editStatus":"Edited","id":"0ac53ff5-5055-4337-bd65-397662dc78c3","owner":{"id":"45835309","username":"jazzjohal00","firstName":"Jaswinder","lastName":"Johal","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/45749889/2.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/45749889/2.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/45749889/2.jpg"},"roles":["PI","Verified","Regular","Depositor"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":218,"piLevel":4},"obsoleteId":"0ac53ff5-5055-4337-bd65-397662dc78c3","parent":{"id":"dd2adc70-a526-11f1-8080-80017373e029","obsoleteId":"dd2adc70-a526-11f1-8080-80017373e029","type":"Post"},"created":"2026-09-01T13:40:53.283Z"},"repliesCount":0,"emotionsData":{"like":{"paging":{"totalCount":0}}},"requesterContext":{"isFlaggingAsSpam":false,"isSubscribed":false,"isLiking":false,"isSaved":false,"isPinned":false,"isRequesterBlocking":false,"isInteractionRestricted":false,"isFollowing":false,"isOwner":false},"replies":[]},{"entity":{"message":{"text":"Curious to see what the upcoming iPhone event signals for their direction.","languageCode":"en-gb"},"updated":"2026-09-01T10:54:43.24Z","isSpam":false,"editStatus":"Edited","id":"fd821509-a968-4634-b4f4-d41fb3c945a6","owner":{"id":"33389434","username":"Seeking-Invests","firstName":"Max","lastName":"Risch","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/33151019/4.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/33151019/4.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/33151019/4.jpg"},"roles":["PI","Verified","Regular","Depositor"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":79,"piLevel":2},"obsoleteId":"fd821509-a968-4634-b4f4-d41fb3c945a6","parent":{"id":"dd2adc70-a526-11f1-8080-80017373e029","obsoleteId":"dd2adc70-a526-11f1-8080-80017373e029","type":"Post"},"created":"2026-08-31T22:09:10.529Z"},"repliesCount":0,"emotionsData":{"like":{"paging":{"totalCount":0}}},"requesterContext":{"isFlaggingAsSpam":false,"isSubscribed":false,"isLiking":false,"isSaved":false,"isPinned":false,"isRequesterBlocking":false,"isInteractionRestricted":false,"isFollowing":false,"isOwner":false},"replies":[]},{"entity":{"message":{"text":"You have missed the huge potential of running local AI models on Mac Studio without a cloud service involved. The cost, reliability and security benefits are massive for small for SMEs and public service providers. Check it out. Apple has not spent capex building data centres, this is shaping as a very smart latecomer strategy. ","languageCode":"en-gb"},"updated":"2026-09-01T10:54:28.835Z","isSpam":false,"editStatus":"Edited","id":"90cea3e0-8145-441e-8cd8-c5b97d51e381","owner":{"id":"24625041","username":"AndyTP","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/images/avatoros/35x35/gb.png","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/images/avatoros/50x50/gb.png","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/images/avatoros/150x150/gb.png"},"roles":["Verified","Regular","Depositor"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":218,"piLevel":0},"obsoleteId":"90cea3e0-8145-441e-8cd8-c5b97d51e381","parent":{"id":"dd2adc70-a526-11f1-8080-80017373e029","obsoleteId":"dd2adc70-a526-11f1-8080-80017373e029","type":"Post"},"created":"2026-08-31T13:02:43.728Z"},"repliesCount":0,"emotionsData":{"like":{"paging":{"totalCount":0}}},"requesterContext":{"isFlaggingAsSpam":false,"isSubscribed":false,"isLiking":false,"isSaved":false,"isPinned":false,"isRequesterBlocking":false,"isInteractionRestricted":false,"isFollowing":false,"isOwner":false},"replies":[]},{"entity":{"message":{"text":"Distribution is the real moat. The risk is timing: on-device AI only pays if the next iPhone cycle actually moves attach and services, not just another hardware refresh. I’d rather see services growth and AI feature adoption than a bigger model announcement. What would you need from the event to call it a real step?","languageCode":"en-gb"},"updated":"2026-09-01T05:33:29.591Z","isSpam":false,"editStatus":"Edited","id":"c543aafd-9f9a-405f-a563-93955e2eb301","owner":{"id":"6373077","username":"jmartinm015","firstName":"Juan Jose","lastName":"Martin Mendez","avatar":{"small":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/35X35/6088065/19.jpg","medium":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/50X50/6088065/19.jpg","large":"https://etoro-cdn.etorostatic.com/avatars/150X150/6088065/19.jpg"},"roles":["PI","Verified","Regular","Depositor"],"isBlocked":false,"isPrivate":false,"countryCode":191,"piLevel":4},"obsoleteId":"c543aafd-9f9a-405f-a563-93955e2eb301","parent":{"id":"dd2adc70-a526-11f1-8080-80017373e029","obsoleteId":"dd2adc70-a526-11f1-8080-80017373e029","type":"Post"},"created":"2026-08-31T11:09:29.457Z"},"repliesCount":0,"emotionsData":{"like":{"paging":{"totalCount":0}}},"requesterContext":{"isFlaggingAsSpam":false,"isSubscribed":false,"isLiking":false,"isSaved":false,"isPinned":false,"isRequesterBlocking":false,"isInteractionRestricted":false,"isFollowing":false,"isOwner":false},"replies":[]}]},"emotionsData":{"like":{"paging":{"totalCount":9},"emotions":[]}},"requesterContext":{"isFlaggingAsSpam":false,"isSubscribed":false,"isLiking":false,"isSaved":false,"isPinned":false,"isRequesterBlocking":false,"isInteractionRestricted":false,"isFollowing":false,"isOwner":false},"summary":{"totalCommentsAndReplies":5,"sharedCount":0},"additionalData":{"reliableRecAiAssets":[{"assetId":1001,"score":1.0}]}}],"paging":{"next":"","offSet":0,"take":1,"version":"v2"},"metadata":{"experimentName":"","streamType":"","designatedStreamType":""}}